  "metadata": {
    "name": "Benchmark 01 — Three Gaps",
    "author": "prototype",
    "description": "First greybox benchmark. Cross three kill-zone gaps to the raised goal. High route: fire nodes at the ceiling strips and swing (retract near the end of each swing for height/speed). Low route: hop the platforms and recovery ledges. The middle anchor is no-node, forcing a different choice over gap 2. A destructible barrier guards a quick ground entry to the goal. Expert target ~30s, average ~60s."
